rt. Around it, the last of the light — and the last of you."},{"id":"intro-cam-2","kind":"camera","t":7.465,"dur":2.4,"tx":104,"tz":62,"radius":110,"alpha":-1.9},{"id":"intro-line-3","kind":"line","t":9.865,"dur":2.5,"speaker":"Lady","text":"Whatever happens now, we finish it together.","style":"whisper"},{"id":"intro-line-4","kind":"line","t":12.365,"dur":2.5,"speaker":"Stumpey","text":"Together. For the heart. One last time.","style":"command"}]},{"id":"ending","when":"win","duration":12.345,"clips":[{"id":"ending-cam-0","kind":"camera","t":0,"dur":2,"tx":104,"tz":62,"radius":200,"alpha":-1.9},{"id":"ending-line-1","kind":"line","t":2,"dur":2.5,"speaker":"Doc","text":"It's... over. The dark is gone.","style":"whisper"},{"id":"ending-line-2","kind":"line","t":4.5,"dur":5.445,"text":"The heart shatters into a thousand points of light, and the world holds its breath — then breathes."},{"id":"ending-hold-3","kind":"hold","t":9.945,"dur":2.4}]}]},"obj":[[104,124,7,"survive","Hold the ring while the light gathers.","","The last stand","e5c3o0",{"p":{"waves":8}}],[104,62,7,"destroy","End it here. There is no next road.","","Extinguish the dark heart","e5c3o1",{"t":1}]],"ncb":1}